Model checkpoints and datasets
------------------------------

This source repository does not include private model checkpoints, training
outputs, or private datasets. Local paths such as checkpoints/, datasets/, and
work_dirs/ are ignored by Git and are expected to be populated by users.

Public datasets and checkpoints referenced in the documentation are hosted by
their respective publishers and remain subject to their own licenses and terms.

Release note
------------

Before each public release, maintainers should review this NOTICE file together
with docs/release_license_review.md and confirm that third-party code, model
assets, datasets, and documentation examples remain within the approved public
release boundary.
